    "title": "<p><strong>Table&nbsp;9.01</strong> Morphological features of biliary intraepithelial neoplasia (BilIN)</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "source error",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGridLight\" style=\"width: 467.55pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" width=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117px; border: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Features</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265px; border-top: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-left: none; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Low-grade BilIN (BilIN-1/2)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 310px; border-top: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-left: none; background: #8db3e2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>High-grade BilIN (BilIN-3)</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117px; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-left: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Histology</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Flat pseudopapillary/micropapillary</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Hyperchromatic nuclei</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Increased N:C&nbsp;ratio</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Nuclear stratification</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Preserved nuclear polarity</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 310px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Flat pseudopapillary/micropapillary</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Hyperchromatic and irregular nuclei</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Pleomorphic, bizarre nuclei, increased N:C&nbsp;ratio</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Complex nuclear stratification</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Loss of nuclear polarity</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117px; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-left: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Biliary mucosa involvement</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Relatively small foci or areas</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 310px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Relatively extensive area</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117px; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-left: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Involvement of peribiliary glands</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Infrequent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 310px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Frequent</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117px; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-left: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-top: none; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"104\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Ki-67 proliferation index</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mildly to moderately increased</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 310px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; background: #daeef3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Markedly increased</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 692px; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-left: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"623\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Immunostaining<sup>a</sup></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 28px; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-left: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-image: initial; border-top: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"19\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 89px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"85\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">S100</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">p53</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">p16</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 265px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Mildly to moderately increased</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Usually negative</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Relatively preserved</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 310px; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; border-right: 1pt solid #bfbfbf; padding: 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"260\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Diffuse and strongly positive</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Frequently positive</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\">Decreased</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><sup>a</sup>Overlaps in immunostaining results are wide, precluding their utility in individual cases (see text).</p>",
